    "authorAssociation": "NONE",
    "body": "I recently converted nearly all my nvim to mini. It's amazing! One thing I'm missing is \"goto alternate file\" functionality like a.vim, projectionist.vim, other.nvim. Did I miss a way to do this or would this be a feature request?",
    "bodyHTML": "<p dir=\"auto\">I recently converted nearly all my nvim to mini. It's amazing! One thing I'm missing is \"goto alternate file\" functionality like a.vim, projectionist.vim, other.nvim. Did I miss a way to do this or would this be a feature request?</p>",
    "bodyText": "I recently converted nearly all my nvim to mini. It's amazing! One thing I'm missing is \"goto alternate file\" functionality like a.vim, projectionist.vim, other.nvim. Did I miss a way to do this or would this be a feature request?",
    "category": {
        "createdAt": "2022-01-02T14:24:09Z",
        "description": "Ask the community for help",
        "emoji": ":pray:",
        "emojiHTML": "<div>🙏</div>",
