                    "authorAssociation": "NONE",
                    "body": "Thanks for the quick response. Totally makes sense. I don't really need much other than some basic `foo.go` <-> `foo_test.go` mappings. I don't use 95% of the stuff in these plugins, which is sort of why I was wondering about a \"mini-ish\" version of them. Maybe I'll have to learn just enough nvim lua to write a function with the 5% I need. 😄 ",
